requests
| where timestamp > ago(60m)
| summarize p95 = percentile(duration, 95),
            count = count(),
            timeouts = countif(resultCode == "408" or name has "timeout" or success == false)
        by bin(timestamp, 1m), operation_Name
| make-series s_p95 = avg(p95)
        on timestamp in range(ago(60m), now(), 1m)
        by operation_Name
| extend (p95Anom, baseline, score) = series_decompose_anomalies(s_p95, 3, -1, 'linefit')
| mv-expand timestamp to typeof(datetime),
            s_p95 to typeof(real),
            p95Anom to typeof(real)
| where p95Anom > 0
| project timestamp, operation_Name, p95 = s_p95, p95Anom